    /// Flags specifying the current power state.
    ///
    /// If [`EXTERNAL_SOURCE`][Self::EXTERNAL_SOURCE] is set, the device is powerered by an
    /// external source; otherwise it is powered by a battery.
    ///
    /// If [`BATTERY_CONNECTED`][Self::BATTERY_CONNECTED] is set, the battery is connected;
    /// otherwise the battery is not connected.
    ///
    /// If [`BATTERY_CHARGING`][Self::BATTERY_CHARGING] is set, the battery is being charged;
    /// otherwise the battery is not being charged.
